---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Experiences — Glitter Hooves & Fairytails" description="Trauma-informed, neurodivergent-friendly farm programs for children, families, and adults.">

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header fade-up">
      <span class="section-label">What We Offer</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Farm experiences for every soul</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">At Glitter Hooves & Fairy Tails Farm, everything we offer is designed with intention — creating a peaceful space where children, families, and adults can slow down, connect, and experience meaningful moments through animals and nature.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="experience-grid">
      <div class="exp-card fade-up">
        <div class="exp-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</div>
        <h2>Gentle Hooves: Fostering Hope</h2>
        <p class="exp-subtitle">A Signature Program of Glitter Hooves &amp; Fairytails Farm</p>
        <p>Gentle Hooves: Fostering Hope is a trauma-informed farm connection program created specifically for children and families impacted by foster care, kinship care, adoption, and family reunification.</p>
        <p>We believe every child deserves a safe place to belong. Through meaningful experiences with animals, nature, creativity, and connection, we provide opportunities for children to build confidence, strengthen emotional regulation skills, develop healthy relationships, and simply experience the joy of being a kiddo.</p>
        <p>Children in foster care often carry stories, transitions, and experiences that others may never see. Our goal is not to focus on what has happened to them, but to create a space where they can feel safe, accepted, and valued exactly as they are.</p>
        <p>Through goat interactions, hands-on farm activities, sensory-conscious experiences, nature exploration, mindfulness, and creative expression, children are encouraged to build resilience, confidence, and connection in a supportive and welcoming environment.</p>
        <p>Because every child deserves a place where they are never too much, never not enough, and always welcome.</p>
        <p>Tiny Hooves — Safe Spaces — Fostering Hope</p>
      </div>

      <div class="exp-card fade-up">
        <div class="exp-icon">🌿</div>
        <h2>Gentle Hooves Mindful Farm Program</h2>
        <p class="exp-subtitle">Children's Signature Program!</p>
        <p>A gentle, structured experience rooted in connection, calm, and confidence. Our signature 4-week program invites children (ages 5–9) to slow down, connect with animals, and build confidence through guided mindfulness and hands-on farm experiences.</p>
        <div class="price">$99 <small>/ child</small></div>
        <div class="price">$50 <small>/ child to reserve</small></div>
      </div>

      <div class="exp-card fade-up">
        <div class="exp-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</div>
        <h2>Farm Connection Visits</h2>
        <p class="exp-subtitle">A Private, Personalized Farm Experience</p>
        <p>Slow down. Connect. Make memories together.</p>
        <p>Includes a 1-hour private farm visit where you'll meet our resident goats, explore nature, do simple activities or crafts, and have photo opportunities.</p>
        <p>Perfect for families, homeschoolers, neurodivergent children, foster & adoptive families, and any animal lovers.</p>
        <p>Private bookings are available by appointment only.</p>
        <div class="price">$45 <small>includes 1 adult + 1 child</small></div>
        <div class="price">+$30 <small>/ additional child</small></div>
        <div class="price">+$10 <small>/ additional adult</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
